  "body": "Auction:  6.00pm, Tuesday 10 November (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nBeachside lifestyle & space in Macleans zone!\r\n\r\nWelcome to this beautifully rendered brick and tile, two-level home which combines timeless character with contemporary comfort on one of the most sought-after streets in Bucklands Beach. Zoned for Macleans College and just a short stroll from the beach, this property offers an outstanding lifestyle in a premium location. Set on a generous 743sqm (more or less) freehold section, it offers spacious living, modern comforts and exciting future potential. \r\n\r\nDesigned with family living in mind, the home features multiple light-filled living areas across two levels. The ground floor offers two separate lounges, three bedrooms, two bathrooms (including an ensuite), a dedicated office and a sunroom, providing excellent flexibility for extended family, guests or working from home. \r\n\r\nUpstairs, an open plan living and dining area flows seamlessly into a modern kitchen, while the private master suite with its own ensuite provides a peaceful retreat. Double glazing throughout most of the home, together with central air conditioning, ensures year-round comfort. \r\n\r\nSolidly constructed with a rendered brick finish and complemented by a tastefully updated interior, the home is ready to enjoy while offering scope to further enhance and add value over time. Outside, the level, fully fenced section is designed for easy living, featuring an automatic gate and generous off-street parking for multiple vehicles or even a boat. \r\n\r\nJust a short stroll from the beach and zoned for highly regarded schools, including Macleans College, this property presents an outstanding opportunity for families seeking space and lifestyle, investors looking for versatility, or land bankers exploring future possibilities. With potential for subdivision or further development, subject to Council approval, this is an opportunity to secure a substantial freehold property in a highly desirable location.\r\n\r\n* Find more properties you may like at - https://www.teamvishrealestate.co.nz/",
